    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present this beautifully presented 3 bedroom terrace home, newly renovated throughout and ready to move straight into. This is a fantastic opportunity for first time buyers, families, or investors alike.\n\nThe heart of the home is a large modern kitchen, dining and living area, bright, spacious, and perfect for entertaining or everyday family life. The property also benefits from two newly fitted bathrooms, giving real flexibility for a busy household.\n\nTo the rear, a newly constructed outside room adds excellent versatile space ideal as a home office, gym, playroom, or additional living/entertaining area, and a real bonus in today`s market.\n\nThis property is finished to a high standard with quality fittings throughout, 32 Liscannor Road offers turnkey living in a convenient location close to local amenities, schools, and transport links.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate everything this home has to offer.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\nComposite hall door, Hard wood floor coverings and access to the main living room\n\nLiving Room - 3.92m (12'10\") x 4.86m (15'11\")\nwith solid wood floor coverings and feature open fireplace with slate hearth surround\n\nHome office nook - 0.95m (3'1\") x 1.93m (6'4\")\nBuilt in work space\n\nBathroom - 1.82m (6'0\") x 1.93m (6'4\")\nNewly fitted bathroom with Bath, w.c & w.h.b. and vanity unit. Heated towel rail, Tiled floor coverings & partially tiled walls.\n\nKitchen - 5.99m (19'8\") x 4.29m (14'1\")\nWith a range of modern floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback. Integrated dishwasher, oven, electric hob & extractor fan.\n\nUtility Room\nPlumbed for washing machine & tumble dryer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.67m (12'0\") x 3.28m (10'9\")\nto front of house with hard wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.82m (6'0\") x 1.17m (3'10\")\nwith w.c, w.h.b. vanity unit, electric shower & heated towel rail. Tiled floor & partially tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.43m (11'3\") x 2.63m (8'8\")\nTo rear of the property with hard wood floor coverings\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.48m (8'2\") x 2.14m (7'0\")\nHard wood floor coverings, stairs to loft space, sky light\n\nGarden Room\nComposite entrance door, Laminate floor coverings, storage press\n\n"
      },
      {
